# Unreal Engine: everything the engine or Visual Studio can regenerate
**/Binaries/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/.vs/
**/*.sln
**/*.slnx
**/*.suo
**/*.VC.db
**/*.VC.opendb
**/*.opensdf
**/*.sdf
**/*_BuiltData.uasset

# Packaged builds
**/Build/*
!**/Build/**/*.ico
dist/

# Generated by high-end\tools from the read-only sources
data/
# ...but the game's run-time data (Erlangen.bin) is committed
!FSLapUE/Content/FS/Data/

# Rebuilt by tools\adtm\adtm_codegen.m (the generated C++ in Private\ADTM is committed)
tools/adtm/adtm_params.mat
tools/adtm/*.mexw64

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
*.bak
